KNOWNBUG
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] line \d+ nested out-of-line ctor ran: SUCCESS$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
--
The out-of-line definition of a nested class's constructor inside a
class template (Outer<T>::sentry::sentry(Outer<T>&)) is never
attached to the instantiated member: "no body for callee
sentry::sentry".  Header-free; the shape of libc++ basic_ostream's
sentry ([ostream.sentry]).  g++/clang++/valgrind clean.
